-- Schema for the deposit CRM, dumped from the running production database.
--
-- Not generated by drizzle-kit push: src/db/schema.ts declares players.username
-- globally unique, while the database scopes it per company
-- (players_company_username_key). A database built from push would refuse a
-- member code another company already uses, which is the whole point of the
-- multi-tenant tree. Regenerate with:
